msgid ""
"Meteo presents current conditions, a 48-hour outlook and a 15-day forecast "
"in a responsive GNOME interface."
msgstr ""
"Meteo presenta las condiciones actuales, un pronóstico de 48 horas y uno "
"de 15 días en una interfaz GNOME adaptable."

#: data/io.github.sylith_technologies.Meteo.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Open-Meteo, MET Norway and the U.S. National Weather Service are kept "
"visibly separate. An experimental weighted consensus is available when at "
"least two compatible sources respond."
msgstr ""
"Open-Meteo, MET Norway y el Servicio Meteorológico Nacional de EE. UU. se "
"mantienen claramente separados. Hay un consenso ponderado experimental "
"disponible cuando responden al menos dos fuentes compatibles."

#: data/io.github.sylith_technologies.Meteo.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Official warnings retain their original authority and are never averaged "
"with model-derived forecast signals."
msgstr ""
"Las alertas oficiales conservan su autoridad original y nunca se promedian "
"con señales de pronóstico derivadas de modelos."

#: data/io.github.sylith_technologies.Meteo.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"First public alpha with privacy-safe local storage, truthful missing-data "
"handling, bounded offline cache, provider isolation, weather and air "
"quality, and an experimental opt-in consensus."
msgstr ""
"Primera alfa pública con almacenamiento local que respeta la privacidad, "
"tratamiento honesto de datos faltantes, caché sin conexión limitada, "
"aislamiento de proveedores, meteorología y calidad del aire, y un consenso "
"experimental opcional."
